browsing with nothing picked
  acts   space pick · v pick all · m move
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up]
  full   [ctrl+d half page down, ctrl+u half page up, g g first row, G last row]
  full   [space pick or unpick this issue, v pick every issue in this section, m move these issues to a sprint or the backlog]
something picked
  acts   space pick · v pick all · m move · x unpick all
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up]
  full   [ctrl+d half page down, ctrl+u half page up, g g first row, G last row]
  full   [space pick or unpick this issue, v pick every issue in this section, m move these issues to a sprint or the backlog, x unpick everything]
choosing where they go
  acts   enter move here · esc cancel
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up]
  full   [enter move them here, esc leave them where they are]
confirming the move
  acts   y go ahead · esc cancel
  full   [y go ahead, esc leave them where they are]
